            title: "7A-7B. Naturaleza, fechas y was/were",
            rule: "Pasado de 'be' ('was/were') y fechas ordinales",
            theory: "En pasado, 'was/wasn't' se usa con I/he/she/it y 'were/weren't' con you/we/they. Las fechas usan números ordinales (first, second, third, eighteenth...).",
            formula: "I/He/She/It + was/wasn't | You/We/They + were/weren't",
