              { text: "I walked to school every morning", alt: [], ipa: "/aɪ wɔːkt tə skuːl ˈevri ˈmɔːrnɪŋ/", es: "ái uókt tu skul év-ri mór-ning", meaning: "Caminaba a la escuela cada mañana", tip: "'Walked' termina con sonido de 't' ('uókt')." },
